  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/a45b5b9191c13cd4da310eb8df100becb078c240f4b0e763420ec154fb42a5fd.png] \n\nDecoding the information,\n\n \n \n\n Sign\n -\n +\n ×\n ÷\n \n \n\n Means\n ÷\n ×\n -\n +\n \n \n\n \n\nGiven equation: {42 × [290 × {125 - 5 + (28 × 22)}] - 22} - 7 = ?\n\nAfter replacing the sign from left to right and using BODMAS rule, we get \n\nNew Equation: {42 - [290 - {125 ÷ 5 × (__**28 - 22**__)}] ÷ 22} ÷ 7 = ?\n\n⇒ {42 - [290 - {__**125 **____**÷**____** 5**__ × 6}] ÷ 22} ÷ 7\n\n⇒ {42 - [290 - {__**25 **____**×**____** 6**__}] ÷ 22} ÷ 7\n\n⇒ {42 - [__**290 - 15**__**__0]__** ÷ 22} ÷ 7\n\n⇒ {42 - 140 ÷ __**2**____**2**__} ÷ 7\n\n⇒ {42 - __**140 **÷ 4__} ÷ 7\n\n⇒ {__**42 - 35**__} ÷ 7 \n\n⇒ __**7 ÷ 7**__\n\n⇒ **1**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"1\".",
